msgid ""
"For self-assignments during initialization (`T v = v;`), `core.uninitialized."
"Assign` will not report them as uninitialized accesses (except C++ reference "
"types), and the checks will be delayed until the first accesses of these "
"variables; `deadcode.DeadStores` will not report them as dead stores. "
"(#GH187530)"
msgstr ""

