msgid ""
"Added parsing and semantic support for `dims` modifier in `num_teams`, "
"`thread_limit` and `num_threads` clauses for OpenMP 6.1 or later."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ReleaseNotes.md:747
msgid ""
"Map-type-modifying modifiers applied to a list item with a user-defined "
"mapper are now propagated onto the maps the mapper expands to."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ReleaseNotes.md:749
msgid ""
"Mapping of expressions with base-pointers through a user-defined mapper (e."
"g. `map(s.p[0:n])`) now conforms to OpenMP's conditional pointer-attachment, "
"matching the behavior of such maps outside a mapper."
